When an R number is combined with a Z3 expression, as in \code{x + 0.1}, it
is converted as follows:
\itemize{
\item Whole numbers become exact integers. Whole numbers beyond 2^53 are
rejected, because R may already have rounded them; pass them as
strings or \code{gmp::bigz} instead.
